      <p begin="00:08.040" end="00:13.399" ttm:agent="v1">I got a whole lot of sticks and ammo, b****, I loaded the magazine</p>
      <p begin="00:13.399" end="00:16.922" ttm:agent="v1">I look like to model, I look like I'm 'posed to just pose on the cover of magazines</p>
      <p begin="00:16.922" end="00:20.471" ttm:agent="v1">My b**** like a model, she look too bad, but nah, she ain't too bad for me</p>
      <p begin="00:20.471" end="00:22.478" ttm:agent="v1">Me and the gang, we slide, we creep</p>
      <p begin="00:22.478" end="00:26.248" ttm:agent="v1">I'm in a Trackhawk Jeep, my boy in the 720S, McLaren</p>
      <p begin="00:26.248" end="00:29.261" ttm:agent="v1">Suicide doors on the creature, my main ho trippin', yeah</p>
      <p begin="00:29.261" end="00:31.048" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause I don't be caring, I'm too damn evil</p>
      <p begin="00:31.048" end="00:34.817" ttm:agent="v1">I can't even lie, you pretty, baby, but I don't think that I need you</p>
      <p begin="00:34.817" end="00:38.835" ttm:agent="v1">Huh, I'm sippin' on red, yeah, my young n****'ll wet you up</p>
      <p begin="00:38.835" end="00:42.348" ttm:agent="v1">I got rich, upper echelon, my bad b**** too wet, yeah</p>
      <p begin="00:42.348" end="00:45.860" ttm:agent="v1">I got water, I got way more water than a bathtub</p>
      <p begin="00:45.860" end="00:49.435" ttm:agent="v1">I just been tweakin' lately, huh, I don't give no f***</p>
      <p begin="00:49.435" end="00:52.951" ttm:agent="v1">Tell that ho to pull up, I'ma throw it, throw more than a dub</p>
