      <p begin="00:56.713" end="00:59.489" ttm:agent="v1">I'm at Prime Italian, in Miami, b****, I'm eatin' good</p>
      <p begin="00:59.489" end="01:03.252" ttm:agent="v1">I know my n***** tied, so I gotta get up out that hood</p>
