      <p begin="01:10.551" end="01:13.831" ttm:agent="v1">I don't get tired, real vamp, b****, I'm up all night</p>
      <p begin="01:13.831" end="01:17.419" ttm:agent="v1">I f*** thick hoes, real thick hoes, super thighs</p>
